<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>English Adventure: The Language Quest</title>
<style>
  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: 'Segoe UI', 'Comic Sans MS', sans-serif; }
  :root {
    --blue: #3B82F6; --purple: #8B5CF6; --yellow: #FBBF24;
    --green: #10B981; --pink: #EC4899; --dark: #1E293B;
  }
  body {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 50%, #f093fb 100%);
    min-height: 100vh; color: #fff; overflow-x: hidden;
    background-attachment: fixed;
  }
  /* Floating background bubbles */
  .bg-bubbles { position: fixed; inset: 0; overflow: hidden; pointer-events: none; z-index: 0; }
  .bubble {
    position: absolute; bottom: -100px; border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,.15); animation: rise linear infinite;
  }
  @keyframes rise {
    0% { transform: translateY(0) translateX(0); opacity: 0; }
    10% { opacity: .6; }
    100% { transform: translateY(-110vh) translateX(50px); opacity: 0; }
  }

  .app { position: relative; z-index: 1; min-height: 100vh; padding: 20px; }

  /* ===== Screens ===== */
  .screen { display: none; animation: fadeIn .5s ease; }
  .screen.active { display: block; }
  @keyframes fadeIn { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); } }

  /* ===== Start Screen ===== */
  .start-screen {
    min-height: 90vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center; justify-content: center; text-align: center;
  }
  .game-title {
    font-size: clamp(32px, 6vw, 64px); font-weight: 900;
    background: linear-gradient(45deg, #FBBF24, #EC4899, #8B5CF6, #3B82F6);
    -webkit-background-clip: text; background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    text-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.3);
    margin-bottom: 10px; animation: titlePulse 2s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
  @keyframes titlePulse {
    0%,100% { transform: scale(1); } 50% { transform: scale(1.03); }
  }
  .subtitle { font-size: clamp(14px, 2.5vw, 20px); margin-bottom: 30px; opacity: .95; }
  .mascot {
    font-size: clamp(80px, 15vw, 140px);
    animation: bounce 2s ease-in-out infinite;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 10px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.3));
  }
  @keyframes bounce {
    0%,100% { transform: translateY(0) rotate(-5deg); }
    50% { transform: translateY(-20px) rotate(5deg); }
  }
  .name-input {
    padding: 14px 20px; font-size: 18px; border: 3px solid #fff;
    border-radius: 30px; background: rgba(255,255,255,.2);
    color: #fff; text-align: center; width: min(320px, 80vw);
    margin: 20px 0; backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
  }
  .name-input::placeholder { color: rgba(255,255,255,.7); }
  .name-input:focus { outline: none; background: rgba(255,255,255,.3); }

  .btn {
    padding: 14px 40px; font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold;
    border: none; border-radius: 30px; cursor: pointer;
    color: #fff; transition: all .3s;
    box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.3);
    text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px;
  }
  .btn:hover { transform: translateY(-3px) scale(1.05); box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,.4); }
  .btn:active { transform: translateY(0); }
  .btn-primary { background: linear-gradient(45deg, var(--yellow), #F59E0B); color: var(--dark); }
  .btn-success { background: linear-gradient(45deg, var(--green), #059669); }
  .btn-info { background: linear-gradient(45deg, var(--blue), var(--purple)); }
  .btn-pink { background: linear-gradient(45deg, var(--pink), #DB2777); }
  .btn-small { padding: 8px 18px; font-size: 14px; }

  /* ===== Map Screen ===== */
  .map-header {
    display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
    background: rgba(0,0,0,.3); padding: 12px 20px; border-radius: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 20px; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px;
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
  }
  .player-info { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }
  .player-avatar {
    width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 50%;
    background: linear-gradient(45deg, var(--yellow), var(--pink));
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    font-size: 22px;
  }
  .stats { display: flex; gap: 15px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .stat-box {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,.2); padding: 6px 14px;
    border-radius: 15px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: bold;
  }

  .map-title { text-align: center; font-size: clamp(22px, 4vw, 32px); margin-bottom: 20px; }

  .level-grid {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
    gap: 20px; max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .level-card {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,.15); backdrop-filter: blur(15px);
    border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,.3); border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 20px; cursor: pointer; transition: all .3s;
    position: relative; overflow: hidden;
  }
  .level-card:hover:not(.locked) {
    transform: translateY(-8px) scale(1.03);
    box-shadow: 0 15px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.4);
    border-color: var(--yellow);
  }
  .level-card.locked { opacity: .5; cursor: not-allowed; filter: grayscale(.5); }
  .level-card.completed { border-color: var(--green); }
  .level-icon {
    font-size: 50px; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 10px;
    animation: floaty 3s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
  @keyframes floaty { 0%,100% { transform: translateY(0); } 50% { transform: translateY(-8px); } }
  .level-name { font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .level-desc { font-size: 13px; text-align: center; opacity: .9; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .level-stars { text-align: center; font-size: 22px; letter-spacing: 3px; }
  .lock-icon {
    position: absolute; top: 10px; right: 10px;
    font-size: 24px; opacity: .7;
  }

  /* ===== Game Screen ===== */
  .game-header {
    display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
    background: rgba(0,0,0,.3); padding: 12px 20px; border-radius: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 20px; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px;
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
  }
  .level-title { font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; }
  .timer {
    background: linear-gradient(45deg, var(--yellow), #F59E0B);
    color: var(--dark); padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: 15px;
    font-weight: bold; font-size: 16px;
  }
  .timer.warning { background: linear-gradient(45deg, #EF4444, #DC2626); color: #fff; animation: shake .5s infinite; }
  @keyframes shake { 0%,100% { transform: translateX(0); } 25% { transform: translateX(-3px); } 75% { transform: translateX(3px); } }

  .game-container {
    max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,.1); backdrop-filter: blur(15px);
    border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2); border-radius: 25px;
    padding: 25px;
  }

  .guide {
    display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,.15); padding: 15px;
    border-radius: 15px; margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .guide-avatar { font-size: 50px; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .speech-bubble {
    background: #fff; color: var(--dark); padding: 12px 16px;
    border-radius: 15px; position: relative; font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.5; flex: 1;
  }
  .speech-bubble::before {
    content: ""; position: absolute; left: -10px; top: 15px;
    border: 8px solid transparent; border-right-color: #fff;
  }

  .passage {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,.95); color: var(--dark);
    padding: 18px; border-radius: 15px; margin-bottom: 20px;
    max-height: 250px; overflow-y: auto; font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.7; border-left: 5px solid var(--yellow);
  }
  .passage h3 { margin-bottom: 10px; color: var(--purple); }

  .question-box {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,.15); padding: 18px;
    border-radius: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px;
  }
  .q-progress { font-size: 13px; opacity: .9; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .q-text { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.5; }

  .options { display: grid; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 15px; }
  .option {
    padding: 14px 18px; background: rgba(255,255,255,.15);
    border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,.3); border-radius: 15px;
    cursor: pointer; font-size: 15px; color: #fff; text-align: left;
    transition: all .25s; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px;
  }
  .option:hover:not(:disabled) {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,.3); border-color: var(--yellow);
    transform: translateX(5px);
  }
  .option:disabled { cursor: not-allowed; }
  .option-letter {
    width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,.3); display: flex;
    align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    font-weight: bold; flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .option.correct { background: var(--green); border-color: #059669; animation: pop .4s; }
  .option.wrong { background: #EF4444; border-color: #DC2626; animation: shake .4s; }
  @keyframes pop { 0% { transform: scale(1); } 50% { transform: scale(1.05); } 100% { transform: scale(1); } }

  .feedback {
    text-align: center; padding: 12px; border-radius: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: bold; font-size: 15px;
    animation: fadeIn .3s;
  }
  .feedback.correct { background: var(--green); }
  .feedback.wrong { background: #EF4444; }
  .feedback.timeout { background: #F59E0B; color: var(--dark); }

  .hint-box {
    background: rgba(251,191,36,.2); border: 2px dashed var(--yellow);
    padding: 12px; border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 10px;
    font-size: 14px; animation: fadeIn .3s;
  }

  .action-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; }

  /* ===== Result Screen ===== */
  .result-card {
    max-width: 600px; margin: 40px auto;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,.15); backdrop-filter: blur(15px);
    border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,.3); border-radius: 25px;
    padding: 30px; text-align: center;
  }
  .result-icon { font-size: 80px; margin-bottom: 10px; animation: bounce 2s infinite; }
  .result-title { font-size: 32px; font-weight: 900; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .result-stars { font-size: 50px; letter-spacing: 10px; margin: 15px 0; }
  .result-grade {
    display: inline-block; padding: 8px 24px; border-radius: 20px;
    font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .grade-excellent { background: var(--yellow); color: var(--dark); }
  .grade-verygood { background: var(--green); }
  .grade-good { background: var(--blue); }
  .grade-practice { background: var(--purple); }
  .grade-tryagain { background: var(--pink); }

  .result-stats {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(120px, 1fr));
    gap: 10px; margin: 20px 0;
  }
  .stat-item {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,.15); padding: 15px;
    border-radius: 15px;
  }
  .stat-value { font-size: 28px; font-weight: bold; color: var(--yellow); }
  .stat-label { font-size: 13px; opacity: .9; }

  .result-buttons { display: flex; gap: 10px; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 20px; }

  /* ===== Leaderboard ===== */
  .leaderboard {
    max-width: 600px; margin: 20px auto;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,.15); backdrop-filter: blur(15px);
    border-radius: 20px; padding: 20px;
  }
  .lb-title { text-align: center; font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: 15px; }
  .lb-row {
    display: flex; align-items: center; padding: 10px 15px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,.1); border-radius: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 8px; gap: 12px;
  }
  .lb-rank {
    width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--yellow); color: var(--dark);
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    font-weight: bold; flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .lb-rank.gold { background: linear-gradient(45deg, #FFD700, #FFA500); }
  .lb-rank.silver { background: linear-gradient(45deg, #C0C0C0, #A8A8A8); }
  .lb-rank.bronze { background: linear-gradient(45deg, #CD7F32, #B87333); }
  .lb-name { flex: 1; font-weight: bold; }
  .lb-score { font-weight: bold; color: var(--yellow); }

  /* ===== Confetti ===== */
  .confetti {
    position: fixed; width: 10px; height: 10px;
    pointer-events: none; z-index: 100;
    animation: confettiFall 3s linear forwards;
  }
  @keyframes confettiFall {
    0% { transform: translateY(-100vh) rotate(0); opacity: 1; }
    100% { transform: translateY(100vh) rotate(720deg); opacity: 0; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .app { padding: 10px; }
    .game-container, .result-card { padding: 15px; }
    .q-text { font-size: 16px; }
    .option { font-size: 14px; padding: 10px 12px; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="bg-bubbles" id="bgBubbles"></div>

<div class="app">

  <!-- ========== START SCREEN ========== -->
  <div class="screen active" id="startScreen">
    <div class="start-screen">
      <div class="mascot">🧙‍♂️</div>
      <h1 class="game-title">English Adventure</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">✨ The Language Quest ✨</p>
      <p style="max-width:500px; margin-bottom:15px; padding: 0 15px;">
        Join Wizard Lex on an epic journey through 6 magical levels!
        Master vocabulary, texts, and grammar to become the Language Champion!
      </p>
      <input type="text" class="name-input" id="playerName" placeholder="Enter your name, hero..." maxlength="20">
      <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="startGame()">🚀 START ADVENTURE</button>
      <button class="btn btn-info btn-small" style="margin-top:15px;" onclick="showLeaderboard()">🏆 Leaderboard</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ========== MAP SCREEN ========== -->
  <div class="screen" id="mapScreen">
    <div class="map-header">
      <div class="player-info">
        <div class="player-avatar">🧑‍🎓</div>
        <div>
          <div style="font-weight:bold;" id="displayName">Hero</div>
          <div style="font-size:12px; opacity:.8;">Adventurer</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="stats">
        <div class="stat-box">⭐ <span id="totalStars">0</span>/18</div>
        <div class="stat-box">💎 <span id="totalScore">0</span> pts</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h2 class="map-title">🗺️ Choose Your Quest</h2>
    <div class="level-grid" id="levelGrid"></div>

    <div style="text-align:center; margin-top:25px;">
      <button class="btn btn-info btn-small" onclick="showLeaderboard()">🏆 Leaderboard</button>
      <button class="btn btn-pink btn-small" onclick="backToStart()">🏠 Home</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ========== GAME SCREEN ========== -->
  <div class="screen" id="gameScreen">
    <div class="game-header">
      <div class="level-title" id="currentLevelTitle">Level 1</div>
      <div class="timer" id="timer">⏱ 30s</div>
      <div class="stat-box">💎 <span id="levelScore">0</span></div>
    </div>

    <div class="game-container">
      <div class="guide">
        <div class="guide-avatar">🧙‍♂️</div>
        <div class="speech-bubble" id="guideText">Welcome, adventurer! Let's begin!</div>
      </div>

      <div id="passageArea"></div>

      <div class="question-box">
        <div class="q-progress" id="qProgress">Question 1 of 10</div>
        <div class="q-text" id="qText"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="options" id="options"></div>

      <div id="hintArea"></div>
      <div id="feedbackArea"></div>

      <div class="action-row">
        <button class="btn btn-info btn-small" id="hintBtn" onclick="useHint()">💡 Hint (<span id="hintCount">3</span>)</button>
        <button class="btn btn-primary btn-small hidden" id="nextBtn" onclick="nextQuestion()">Next ➡</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ========== RESULT SCREEN ========== -->
  <div class="screen" id="resultScreen">
    <div class="result-card">
      <div class="result-icon" id="resultIcon">🏆</div>
      <h2 class="result-title" id="resultTitle">Level Complete!</h2>
      <div class="result-stars" id="resultStars">⭐⭐⭐</div>
      <div class="result-grade" id="resultGrade">Excellent!</div>
      <div class="result-stats">
        <div class="stat-item"><div class="stat-value" id="rCorrect">0</div><div class="stat-label">Correct</div></div>
        <div class="stat-item"><div class="stat-value" id="rTotal">10</div><div class="stat-label">Questions</div></div>
        <div class="stat-item"><div class="stat-value" id="rScore">0</div><div class="stat-label">Points</div></div>
        <div class="stat-item"><div class="stat-value" id="rPercent">0%</div><div class="stat-label">Accuracy</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="result-buttons">
        <button class="btn btn-success btn-small" onclick="retryLevel()">🔄 Retry</button>
        <button class="btn btn-primary btn-small" onclick="showMap()">🗺️ Map</button>
        <button class="btn btn-info btn-small" id="nextLevelBtn" onclick="nextLevel()">➡ Next Level</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ========== FINAL SCREEN ========== -->
  <div class="screen" id="finalScreen">
    <div class="result-card">
      <div class="result-icon">👑</div>
      <h2 class="result-title">Champion!</h2>
      <p style="margin-bottom:15px;">You've conquered all 6 quests!</p>
      <div class="result-stars" id="finalStars">⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</div>
      <div class="result-stats">
        <div class="stat-item"><div class="stat-value" id="fScore">0</div><div class="stat-label">Total Points</div></div>
        <div class="stat-item"><div class="stat-value" id="fStars">0</div><div class="stat-label">Stars</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="result-grade" id="finalGrade">Excellent!</div>
      <div class="result-buttons">
        <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="playAgain()">🔄 Play Again</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ========== LEADERBOARD SCREEN ========== -->
  <div class="screen" id="leaderboardScreen">
    <div class="leaderboard">
      <h2 class="lb-title">🏆 Hall of Champions</h2>
      <div id="lbList"></div>
      <div style="text-align:center; margin-top:20px;">
        <button class="btn btn-info btn-small" onclick="closeLeaderboard()">← Back</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>

<script>
/* ============================================================
   DATA: 6 LEVELS × 10 QUESTIONS = 60 QUESTIONS
   ============================================================ */
const LEVELS = [
  {
    id: 1, name: "Vocabulary Challenge", icon: "📚",
    desc: "Master English words and their meanings",
    color: "#3B82F6",
    passage: null,
    intro: "Let's test your vocabulary! Choose the correct meaning.",
    questions: [
      { q: "What is the meaning of 'Magnificent'?", o: ["Very small", "Extremely beautiful or impressive", "Very boring", "Extremely loud"], a: 1, h: "Think of a grand palace or a beautiful sunset." },
      { q: "'Curious' means...", o: ["Bored", "Eager to know or learn", "Angry", "Tired"], a: 1, h: "A child asking 'why?' many times." },
      { q: "The synonym of 'Brave' is...", o: ["Cowardly", "Courageous", "Shy", "Lazy"], a: 1, h: "A hero facing danger." },
      { q: "'Enormous' is closest in meaning to...", o: ["Tiny", "Huge", "Average", "Narrow"], a: 1, h: "Think of an elephant compared to a mouse." },
      { q: "What does 'Delicious' mean?", o: ["Very tasty", "Very ugly", "Very sad", "Very cold"], a: 0, h: "How does your favorite food taste?" },
      { q: "The antonym of 'Ancient' is...", o: ["Old", "Modern", "Historical", "Traditional"], a: 1, h: "The opposite of something very old." },
      { q: "'Generous' describes someone who...", o: ["Is selfish", "Likes to give and share", "Is always angry", "Never speaks"], a: 1, h: "A person who donates to charity." },
      { q: "What is a 'Library'?", o: ["A place to swim", "A place to borrow books", "A place to eat", "A place to sleep"], a: 1, h: "A quiet building full of books." },
      { q: "'Persevere' means to...", o: ["Give up quickly", "Continue despite difficulties", "Run away", "Sleep longer"], a: 1, h: "Never giving up, even when things are hard." },
      { q: "The word 'Furious' means...", o: ["Very happy", "Very calm", "Extremely angry", "Very sleepy"], a: 2, h: "Stronger than just 'angry'." }
    ]
  },
  {
    id: 2, name: "Descriptive Text", icon: "🏞️",
    desc: "Describe people, places, and things",
    color: "#10B981",
    passage: {
      title: "Borobudur Temple",
      text: "Borobudur Temple is one of the most famous historical sites in Indonesia. It is located in Magelang, Central Java. Built in the 9th century during the Sailendra Dynasty, Borobudur is the largest Buddhist temple in the world. The temple has ten levels, representing the Buddhist cosmology. It has 2,672 relief panels and 504 Buddha statues. Every year, thousands of tourists from all over the world visit this magnificent temple, especially during sunrise when the view is breathtaking."
    },
    intro: "Read the text about Borobudur, then answer the questions!",
    questions: [
      { q: "Where is Borobudur Temple located?", o: ["Jakarta", "Yogyakarta", "Magelang, Central Java", "Surabaya"], a: 2, h: "Look for the location mentioned in the second sentence." },
      { q: "When was Borobudur built?", o: ["8th century", "9th century", "10th century", "11th century"], a: 1, h: "Find the century in the text." },
      { q: "Which dynasty built Borobudur?", o: ["Majapahit", "Mataram", "Sailendra", "Singasari"], a: 2, h: "Look for 'Dynasty' in the text." },
      { q: "What religion is associated with Borobudur?", o: ["Hindu", "Islam", "Christian", "Buddhist"], a: 3, h: "The text mentions 'the largest ... temple in the world'." },
      { q: "How many Buddha statues are there?", o: ["2,672", "504", "1,000", "200"], a: 1, h: "Look for 'Buddha statues'." },
      { q: "How many relief panels does it have?", o: ["504", "2,672", "1,000", "100"], a: 1, h: "Look for 'relief panels'." },
      { q: "How many levels does the temple have?", o: ["5", "8", "10", "12"], a: 2, h: "Look for 'levels'." },
